even: input=[2, 4, 3, 0, 1, 5, 6] substitution={'F': 2, 'MIDDLE': [4, 3, 0, 1, 5], 'L': 6} canonical=[6, 5, 4, 3, 2, 1, 0] generated=[6, 5, 4, 3, 2, 1, 0]
